<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ThoughtSpace</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1 class="brand">ThoughtSpace<span>&#127775;</span></h1>
        <em class="tagline">Your Voice. Your Story. Your Platform.</em>
        <p>Welcome to ThoughtSpace! — a place built for anyone with something to say.Whether you're sharing a personal story, an opinion, a tutorial, or just an idea you can't stop thinking about, this is your space to put it into words. We believe everyone has a story worth telling, and every voice deserves a place to be heard.No experience needed. No perfect writing required. Just start typing, and let your ideas take shape.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
        <h2>Why ThoughtSpace?</h2>
        <p>Write Without Limits Express yourself in your own style — short thoughts, long essays, guides, or personal stories. It's your platform, your rules.</p>
        <p>Discover Fresh Perspectives Explore content from writers just like you — real people sharing real ideas across every topic imaginable.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
        Got something to say? Thousands of stories start with a single sentence. Yours could be next.

        <a href="/forms.ejs" class="cta-button">Create Your First Post →</a>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>
</body>

</html>